  "title": "Hagerty to Report First Quarter 2026 Results and Host Conference Call on Wednesday, May 6, 2026 - Hagerty",
  "summary": "TRAVERSE CITY, MI. – April 22, 2026 /PRNewswire/ – Hagerty, Inc. (NYSE: HGTY), a business that makes it easier and more enjoyable to be a driving enthusiast, today announced it will report its first quarter 2026 financial results before the market opens on Wednesday, May 6, 2026. Hagerty will hold a conference call to discuss the financial results at 10:00 am Eastern Time on that day. A live webcast of […]",
